// "Venture into the dungeon" [CR#701.49a..701.49c]. Bodyless: the dungeon
// card comes from outside the game [CR#309.2,400.11], which has no place in
// the model yet; the body waits on `core-location-outside-the-game`.
KeywordAction(
    name: "ventureIntoTheDungeon",
    spelling: "venture into the dungeon",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "venture into the dungeon",
        third_person: "ventures into the dungeon",
        frame_set: Intransitive,
    ),
)
